<%!-- title: Basic | text: The default group, exclusive: opening one closes the others --%>
<Accordion.accordion id="accordion-basic">
  <:item title="Does the AI keep my code?" open>
    No. It reads the diff to write the review and then drops it.
  </:item>
  <:item title="Who approves a scope item?">
    A person on your team, after the pull request is merged.
  </:item>
  <:item title="Can I cancel at any time?">
    Yes. The plan ends at the close of the billing month.
  </:item>
</Accordion.accordion>
